TEST 10874 -- OSPFv3 Syncs with neighbour
===========================================================================
Run: 2026-09-22 14:40:12  tb470
Peer: AR4050S over the vlan10 transit, 2001:db8:10::1 <-> ::2, area 0.
Method from the case: cycle the connecting port shutdown/no shutdown, at
least 5 times; the adjacency must time out on shutdown and re-establish.
Spanning tree is disabled on this bench, as the case requires.

--- attachment syntax that works on this platform ---
    interface vlan10 / ipv6 router ospf area 0
  (NOT `ipv6 ospf <n> area <n>` -- that form does not exist here. The command
   lives under `ipv6 router ...`, documented in the AW+ CLI wiki on the share
   at claude/github-copilot-awplus-wiki/awplus_cli_wiki/commands/
   ipv6-router-ospf-area.md)

